      "text": "This writ petition, has been filed, inter alia, for the following relief:\n\" Issue a writ, order or direction in the nature of certiorari quashing the notice dated 16.07.2019 u/s. 46(4) of Food safety and Standards Act issued by respondent no. 3 (Annexure No. 1).\"",
